  "source_parent": "c63a616567a7b9d028b7c651c5bcc86f2912aa56",
  "scope": "Share generated split and gap kernel port-box proof and update both generators",
  "validation": "Paired coherent kernel and wrapper builds and independent regeneration pass. Existing 81 public declaration reports, 55,118 global simp entries and 23,324 instance entries match; six surviving private type/axiom reports match.",
  "limitations": [
    "GapGeometry66 and other transitive project/Foundation/package inputs remain cached; the coherent chain is not a full clean source closure.",
    "The first SplitKernels59 client failed against a stale SelectiveCarry object and is retained but excluded. The successful replay rebuilt SelectiveCarry and three downstream prerequisites.",
    "One public alias is added and the private Gap helper and five generated auxiliaries are removed; no tracked references were found. Global probes do not cover every persistent Lean extension.",
    "Two independent generator runs checked byte-for-byte output, but their scripts rely on captured input data and original toolchain; compiled objects are excluded."
  ],
